# The traffic generator. Unpacked by hand per the README, ~825 MB, and pinned
# to a version in traffic_generator.py:
#   wget -P trex https://trex-tgn.cisco.com/trex/release/v3.08.tar.gz
#   tar -xzf trex/v3.08.tar.gz -C trex
trex/
*.tar.gz

# Benchmark output: one directory per run, holding the report, the CSV, the
# generated generator config, the blocklist, and the raw counter dumps.
# Tens of megabytes per run.
results/
.run/

# Python.
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
.venv/

# uv writes this when something puts it in project mode rather than script
# mode. The benchmark itself runs from the inline metadata at the top of
# main.py, so this is not needed to reproduce a run.
.venv

# Editor and operating system noise.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
